    "AST-LIB-008": "Pass: broad arched timber hood, end cheeks, swept supporting spine, rocker base and recessed diffuser frame read coherently at 640x360. Actual detail exposes the service cover, feed channel and diffuser seating. Fitted study context retains support-plane correspondence. The references support task-light housings and fitted warm finishes; no luminous material or room-light effect is used to carry the shape.",
    "AST-LIB-009": "Pass: both full standing and seated 640x360 views show the complete two-tier browser, separate face-out title groups, lower divided storage and distinct bearings/feet. Three cover designs read by title/color/graphic family at ordinary resolution; subtitle text is detail-only. Corrected CURRENT ISSUES sign lies on the front backing face. Side and front storage voids are actual geometry; no upper inaccessible stock is called universally reachable.",
    "AST-LIB-010": "Pass: full 640x360 standing view establishes framed display, angled control deck, substantial twin supports and clear centre. Actual-use 640x360 view shows the FIND A BOOK hierarchy, collection list and four physically separate controls; small button labels soften at that scale, with full word labels clear in detail. Named native targets coincide with the represented control surfaces. Shape and restrained materials remain legible without a display filter."
